      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 12,
      "end_line": 12,
      "raw": "**Requirements**\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 13,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "- iOS 18.5 deployment target (see project settings).\n- Screen Time data requires a real device and user authorization.\n",
