    {
      "id": "b000021",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 34,
      "end_line": 39,
      "raw": "- `scripts/ci/run_tests_with_coverage.sh` executes tests with code coverage and applies a minimum coverage gate.\n- Journal changes are covered by Pulse view rendering tests and WidgetSnapshot legacy decode coverage.\n- Weekly Rhythm widget chart bounds are covered by `WidgetLayoutMetricsTests`.\n- Coverage threshold can be overridden per run:\n  - `MIN_COVERAGE=55 scripts/ci/run_tests_with_coverage.sh`\n- CI runs automatically on `main` and `codex/**` pushes and on every pull request (`.github/workflows/ios-tests.yml`).\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`scripts/ci/run_tests_with_coverage.sh` executes tests with code coverage and applies a minimum coverage gate.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "Journal changes are covered by Pulse view rendering tests and WidgetSnapshot legacy decode coverage.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "Weekly Rhythm widget chart bounds are covered by `WidgetLayoutMetricsTests`.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "Coverage threshold can be overridden per run:",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`MIN_COVERAGE=55 scripts/ci/run_tests_with_coverage.sh`",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "CI runs automatically on `main` and `codex/**` pushes and on every pull request (`.github/workflows/ios-tests.yml`).",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
    },
